# =============================================================================
# This repository is PUBLIC.
# =============================================================================
# Letterhead .docx files are an organization's private branding. They are read at
# runtime from LETTERHEAD_DIR — a directory outside this repository — and must
# never be committed. Flipping a file into git history is permanent: deleting it
# in a later commit does not remove it from the history a clone carries.
#
# templates/letterheads/generic.docx is the ONE exception and is force-added. It
# is a 1.2 KB placeholder containing the docxtemplater placeholders and the words
# "[ YOUR LETTERHEAD ARTWORK GOES HERE ]" — no artwork, no organization.
# =============================================================================

*.docx
*.doc
!templates/letterheads/generic.docx

# The registry can name a real organization's offices, so a deployment's own copy
# lives beside its .docx files in LETTERHEAD_DIR, not here.
letterheads.local.json

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules/
